WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.780
jab poora sansar Bhagwan Ram
ke vanvaas ki kahani janta hai,

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:09.230
tab lokkatha ke anusar ek aisi stree bhi
thi jisne apne pati ke liye 14 saal tak

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.680
sokar apna tyaag diya.

00:00:10.799 --> 00:00:13.189
lekin uski kahani shayad hi koi janta hai.

00:00:13.289 --> 00:00:18.245
ye kahani hai mata Urmila ki, jo Lakshman
ki patni aur mata Sita ki bahan thin.

00:00:18.295 --> 00:00:22.385
jab Lakshman Bhagwan Ram aur mata
Sita ke saath vanvaas jane lage,

00:00:22.795 --> 00:00:27.555
tab unhone tay kiya ki we 14 saal tak
apne bhai aur bhabhi ki raksha karenge aur

00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:28.825
bilkul nahi soyenge.

00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:30.247
lekin ek samasya thi.

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:33.067
bina soye koi insan 14
saal kaise rah sakta tha?

00:00:33.169 --> 00:00:37.353
lokkatha ke anusar, tabhi Nidra
devi Lakshman ke samne prakat huin.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:42.148
Lakshman ne unse anurodh kiya ki unke
hisse ki neend kisi aur ko de di jaye.

00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:45.611
aur unki patni Urmila ne yeh
zimmedari sveekar kar li.

00:00:45.661 --> 00:00:48.431
kahte hain ki Urmila 14
varshon tak soti rahin,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:52.071
taki Lakshman bina soye
Bhagwan Ram ki seva kar sakein.

00:00:52.171 --> 00:00:55.151
kaha jata hai ki jab
Bhagwan Ram Ayodhya laute,

00:00:55.151 --> 00:00:57.799
tab Urmila ki neend
poori hui aur we jagin.

00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:00.869
ek taraf Lakshman ka tyaag
Ramkatha mein prasiddh hua,

00:01:00.869 --> 00:01:04.719
toh doosri taraf Urmila ka
tyaag parde ke peechhe rah gaya.

00:01:04.817 --> 00:01:09.347
aapke anusar, is kahani ki asli
nayika kaun thin, Lakshman ya Urmila?

